er atom** (=E/2) 2) **Final O–O bond length** from the relaxed geometry (CONTCAR or equivalent) ## Planned workspace layout (paths) - `structures/o2_box/` — initial structure - `vasp_inputs/o2_gas_relax/` — VASP input deck prepared by tool - `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/` — VASP outputs from execution - `analysis/o2_gas_relax/` — parsed summaries (JSON/TXT) - Update memory pointers under `MEMORY/topics/{FILES,FACTS}.md` once results exist. ## Validation / acceptance checks - Relaxation reaches force criterion (max |F| ≤ **0.02 eV/Å** unless tightened). - No obvious SCF failures (electronic convergence reached each step, no exploding energies). - Final O–O bond length reasonable (order ~1.2 Å under PBE for triplet O₂; exact value to be reported from the run). ## Output to report (from VASP results) - **Final energy per atom (eV/atom)** from final ionic step energy / 2. - **Final O–O bond distance (Å)** from relaxed coordinates. - Provide provenance: which output file(s) and which final step was used. ## Notes on reproducibility - Results depend on the exact POTCAR (PBE54 vs other) and VASP version; we’ll record these from OUTCAR headers when present.\", \"Work package count: 5\", \"Work packages: Generate initial O₂ structure in a sufficiently large cubic box (POSCAR) | Prepare VASP gas-phase relaxation inputs (INCAR/KPOINTS/POTCAR) with triplet spin targeting | Execute the VASP relaxation and confirm convergence/termination cleanly | Parse VASP outputs to extract final total energy, energy per atom, and final O–O bond distance; write a small summary artifact | Record final results and key run metadata into MEMORY (FACTS/FILES)\"], \"files\": [], \"constraints\": [], \"open_questions\": [], \"decisions\": [{\"decision\": \"Plan committed\", \"rationale\": \"Approved for execution\"}], \"next_steps\": [\"Generate initial O₂ structure in a sufficiently large cubic box (POSCAR)\", \"Prepare VASP gas-phase relaxation inputs (INCAR/KPOINTS/POTCAR) with triplet spin targeting\"