arkers: `reached required accuracy - stopping structural energy minimisation` (line 4928) and `General timing and accounting informations for this job` (line 4944).\n  - Evidence: `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/OUTCAR`; task structured result (`task_id=task_02`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | result invariant] OSZICAR final ionic-step entry is `4 F= -.98846517E+01 ... mag=     2.0000`, consistent with converged triplet-targeted output.\n  - Evidence: `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/OSZICAR`; task structured result (`task_id=task_02`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | result invariant] Required production outputs are present in `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2`: `OUTCAR`, `CONTCAR`, `OSZICAR`, `vasprun.xml`.\n  - Evidence: `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2`; task structured result (`task_id=task_02`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n\n## Tentative\n- (empty)\n\n## Decision Log\n- [2026-03-02] **Plan committed** for execution.\n  - Rationale: Approved for execution.\n  - Evidence: task structured result (`task_id=plan_commit`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02] **Post-edited INCAR to enforce `NUPDOWN=2` explicitly.**\n  - Rationale: `vasp_relax_prepare` in this environment did not expose `user_incar_settings`; explicit post-edit preserves the triplet-targeting invariant.\n  - Evidence: `vasp_inputs/o2_gas_relax/O2/INCAR`; `reports/o2_incar_check.txt`; task structured result (`task_id=task_01`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02] **Did not modify INCAR before/after execution.**\n  - Rationale: First execution completed cleanly, so failure-recovery parameter edits were unnecessary.\n  - Evidence: task structured result (`task_id=task_02`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n\n</editable_file>\n<editable_file path=\"MEMORY/topics/FILES.md\">\n# FILES\n\n## TL;DR\n- Entry points: `structures/o2_box/O2.vasp`; `vasp_inputs/o2_gas_relax/O2`; `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2`\n- Primary artifacts: prepared gas-pha