e number/text, computed energy per atom (2-atom O2), and computed MIC O–O distance from CONTCAR. Printed all required values to stdout, with optional OSZICAR cross-check.\", \"facts\": [\"Final OUTCAR TOTEN = -9.88465166 eV from line 4898 in vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/OUTCAR (matching text: '  free  energy   TOTEN  =        -9.88465166 eV').\", \"Energy per atom = -4.94232583 eV/atom (TOTEN/2).\", \"Relaxed O–O bond distance from vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/CONTCAR using MIC = 1.2332978239 Å.\", \"OSZICAR last F = -9.88465170 eV; TOTEN - F = 4.0e-08 eV (consistent within rounding).\"], \"files\": [{\"path\": \"analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.json\", \"description\": \"Machine-readable summary containing toten_eV, energy_per_atom_eV, oo_bond_A, and provenance (OUTCAR line number/text + CONTCAR path), plus optional OSZICAR cross-check fields.\", \"kind\": \"output\"}, {\"path\": \"analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.txt\", \"description\": \"Human-readable summary with the same core values and provenance.\", \"kind\": \"report\"}], \"constraints\": [], \"open_questions\": [], \"decisions\": [{\"decision\": \"Used ASE distance with mic=True on CONTCAR for O–O bond length.\", \"rationale\": \"Directly enforces minimum-image convention in the periodic 20 Å cell.\"}], \"next_steps\": [], \"artifacts\": [\"_tool_outputs/bash_exec/bash_exec_20260302T100220114320Z_260a1c7d.json\"]}\n\nEditable file snapshot (authoritative):\n<editable_file path=\"MEMORY/MEMORY.md\">\n# MEMORY (AUTOLOADED INDEX)\n\n## What this is\n- Autoloaded memory index for this project.\n- Keep this file concise and pointer-first.\n- Put details in MEMORY/topics/*.md.\n\n## Latest State\n- Current focus: Extract final observables from the completed gas-phase triplet O2 relaxation.\n- Current milestone: VASP gas-phase triplet O2 relaxation completed successfully with clean termination markers (task: `task_02`, run: `run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- Latest run artifact: `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/{OUTCAR,OSZICAR,CONT