18:04:12 INFO catmaster.runtime.artifact_callback | [llm.context.message] model=openai/gpt-5.3-codex:online callback_run_id=019cae01-61f3-76e1-90a5-c800923148b5 batch=0 idx=1 class=HumanMessage type=human payload={"content": "\nRun id: run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c\nTask id: finalize_memory\nTask goal (short): Reconcile memory to latest run state before summary\nOutcome: done\n\nTask structured result (JSON):\n{\"summary\": \"Parsed final O2 relaxation outputs and wrote machine/human summaries with provenance at analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.json and analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.txt. Extracted last OUTCAR TOTEN with exact line number/text, computed energy per atom (2-atom O2), and computed MIC O–O distance from CONTCAR. Printed all required values to stdout, with optional OSZICAR cross-check.\", \"facts\": [\"Final OUTCAR TOTEN = -9.88465166 eV from line 4898 in vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/OUTCAR (matching text: '  free  energy   TOTEN  =        -9.88465166 eV').\", \"Energy per atom = -4.94232583 eV/atom (TOTEN/2).\", \"Relaxed O–O bond distance from vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/CONTCAR using MIC = 1.2332978239 Å.\", \"OSZICAR last F = -9.88465170 eV; TOTEN - F = 4.0e-08 eV (consistent within rounding).\"], \"files\": [{\"path\": \"analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.json\", \"description\": \"Machine-readable summary containing toten_eV, energy_per_atom_eV, oo_bond_A, and provenance (OUTCAR line number/text + CONTCAR path), plus optional OSZICAR cross-check fields.\", \"kind\": \"output\"}, {\"path\": \"analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.txt\", \"description\": \"Human-readable summary with the same core values and provenance.\", \"kind\": \"report\"}], \"constraints\": [], \"open_questions\": [], \"decisions\": [{\"decision\": \"Used ASE distance with mic=True on CONTCAR for O–O bond length.\", \"rationale\": \"Directly enforces minimum-image convention in the periodic 20 Å cell.\"}], \"next_steps\": [\"None (goal scope complete).\"], \"artifacts\": [{\"path\": \"structures/o2_box/O2.vasp\", \"description\": \"Isolated O2 structure in 20 Å cubic vacuum box (Cartesian coordinates).\", \"source\": \"task_01\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_inputs/o2_gas_relax/O2\", \"description\": \"Prepared VASP gas-phase relaxation input set containing POSCAR/INCAR/KPOINTS/POTCAR.\", \"source\": \"task_01\"}, {\"path\": \"reports/o2_incar_check.txt\", \"description\": \"Concise snippet confirming key INCAR settings for triplet gas-phase relaxation.\", \"source\": \"task_01\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2\", \"description\": \"Completed VASP run directory for gas-phase triplet O2 relaxation.\", \"source\": \"task_02\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/OUTCAR\", \"description\": \"Main VASP output containing convergence and termination markers.\", \"source\": \"task_02\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/OSZICAR\", \"description\": \"Electronic/ionic step log with final F and magnetic moment entries.\", \"source\": \"task_02\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/CONTCAR\", \"description\": \"Final relaxed structure.\", \"source\": \"task_02\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/vasprun.xml\", \"description\": \"XML run record produced by VASP.\", \"source\": \"task_02\"}, {\"path\": \"analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.json\", \"description\": \"Machine-readable summary containing toten_eV, energy_per_atom_eV, oo_bond_A, and provenance (OUTCAR line number/text + CONTCAR path), plus optional OSZICAR cross-check fields.\", \"source\": \"task_03\"}, {\"path\": \"analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.txt\", \"description\": \"Human-readable summary with the same core values and provenance.\", \"source\": \"task_03\"}], \"final_status\": \"done\", \"task_count\": 3, \"completed_task_count\": 3}\n\nEditable file snapshot (authoritative):\n<editable_file path=\"MEMORY/MEMORY.md\">\n# MEMORY (AUTOLOADED INDEX)\n\n## What this is\n- Autoloaded memory index for this project.\n- Keep this file concise and pointer-first.\n- Put details in MEMORY/topics/*.md.\n\n## Latest State\n- Current focus: Preserve finalized O2 gas-phase relaxation observables with provenance for reuse.\n- Current milestone: Final parsing completed (task: `task_03`, run: `run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`) with total energy, energy per atom, and relaxed O–O bond distance extracted.\n- Latest run artifacts: `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/{OUTCAR,OSZICAR,CONTCAR,vasprun.xml}` and `analysis/o2_gas_relax/{summary.json,summary.txt}`.\n- Next action: No active blocker; results are ready for downstream reporting/reuse.\n\n## Top Constraints\n1. Final report must include final total energy (eV), energy per atom (eV/atom), and O–O bond distance (Å) from the final relaxed VASP step with provenance.\n\n## Active Open Questions\n1. None currently (parsing target from task_03 is complete).\n\n## Pointers\n- Goal / principles: MEMORY/topics/GOAL.md\n- Facts / decisions: MEMORY/topics/FACTS.md\n- Files / artifacts: MEMORY/topics/FILES.md\n- Constraints: MEMORY/topics/CONSTRAINTS.md\n- Open questions: MEMORY/topics/QUESTIONS.md\n- Runbook: MEMORY/topics/RUNBOOK.md\n\n## Keyword Map\n- GOAL: objective, success criteria, scope, non-goals\n- FACTS: definition, verified, result, decision\n- FILES: path, artifact, dataset, output, script\n- CONSTRAINTS: must, cannot, policy, budget\n- QUESTIONS: unknown, blocked, clarify, decide\n- RUNBOOK: steps, checklist, verify\n\n</editable_file>\n<editable_file path=\"MEMORY/topics/GOAL.md\">\n# GOAL\n\n## TL;DR\n- Primary objective: Compute O2 in a box: prepare VASP inputs from scratch, DO perform VASP calculation to get the results, and report final energy per atom and O–O bond distance from vasp results.\n- Definition of success: Converged gas-phase O2 relaxation with reported final energy per atom and final bond length, each with output-file provenance.\n- Non-goals: (unchanged)\n\n## Objectives\n- Run a defensible VASP relaxation workflow for isolated O2 in vacuum.\n- Extract reusable final observables: total energy, energy per atom, and O–O bond length.\n\n## Success Criteria\n- VASP relaxation completes with acceptable convergence behavior (electronic + ionic).\n- Final total energy is reported in eV from the final ionic step.\n- Final energy per atom is reported in eV/atom from the final ionic step.\n- Final O–O bond distance is reported in Å from relaxed structure coordinates.\n- Report includes provenance (which file and final step index were used).\n\n## Non-goals\n- (empty)\n\n## Change log\n- [2026-03-02] Compute O2 in a box: prepare VASP inputs from scratch, DO perform VASP calculation to get the results, and report final energy per atom and O–O bond distance from vasp results.\n- [2026-03-02] Added concrete success criteria and provenance requirement for final reported observables.\n\n</editable_file>\n<editable_file path=\"MEMORY/topics/FACTS.md\">\n# FACTS\n\n## TL;DR\n- Canonical definitions: Energy-per-atom and bond-length reporting definitions for this O2 task.\n- Verified facts: Baseline triplet O2 gas-phase protocol was prepared/executed successfully, and final total energy, energy per atom, and relaxed O–O bond distance were extracted with provenance.\n- Tentative hypotheses: (empty)\n\n## Canonical Definitions\n- **Final total energy (this task):** `TOTEN` from the last converged ionic step in `OUTCAR` (`free energy TOTEN`), units `eV`.\n- **Energy per atom (this task):** `E_per_atom = E_final_ionic_step / 2` for O2, units `eV/atom`.\n- **Final O–O bond length (this task):** distance between the two O atoms in the relaxed final structure (`CONTCAR`) evaluated with minimum-image convention (MIC), units `Å`.\n\n## Verified Facts\n- [2026-03-02 | method invariant] Approved baseline protocol for isolated O2 (triplet) in vacuum:\n  - Spin targeting: `ISPIN=2`, `NUPDOWN=2`.\n  - Cell model: cubic box with ~10 Å vacuum padding (about 20 Å lattice).\n  - Baseline settings from MPRelaxSet: PBE-level defaults including `ENCUT=520 eV`, `PREC=Accurate`, `LASPH=.TRUE.`.\n  - Gas-phase preset choices: `calc_type='gas'` with `Γ-only (1×1×1)`, `ISYM=0`, `LREAL=False`, `ISIF=2`.\n  - Ionic relaxation intent: `IBRION=2`, `NSW>0`, tight `EDIFF` (`1e-6`), `EDIFFG` around `-0.02 eV/Å` (acceptable range noted `-0.01` to `-0.02 eV/Å`).\n  - Dispersion correction: off (single isolated molecule in vacuum).\n  - Evidence: task structured result (`task_id=plan_commit`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | result invariant] Isolated O2 structure generated at `structures/o2_box/O2.vasp` with a `20×20×20 Å` lattice; O Cartesian positions are `z=9.395 Å` and `z=10.605 Å`, giving a `1.21 Å` bond centered in the box.\n  - Evidence: `structures/o2_box/O2.vasp`; task structured result (`task_id=task_01`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | result invariant] Gas-phase relaxation input set prepared at `vasp_inputs/o2_gas_relax/O2` containing `POSCAR`, `INCAR`, `KPOINTS`, and `POTCAR`.\n  - Evidence: task structured result (`task_id=task_01`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | result invariant] Prepared INCAR was verified to include `IBRION=2`, `NSW=500`, `ISPIN=2`, `NUPDOWN=2`, `ISYM=0`, and `LREAL=False`.\n  - Evidence: `reports/o2_incar_check.txt`; task structured result (`task_id=task_01`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | acceptance invariant] Planned validation checks for production run:\n  - Force convergence target at or below `0.02 eV/Å`.\n  - No obvious SCF failure patterns during relaxation.\n  - Evidence: task structured result (`task_id=plan_commit`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | result invariant] VASP gas-phase triplet O2 relaxation executed in single-folder batch mode using input `vasp_inputs/o2_gas_relax/O2`, producing run output directory `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2`.\n  - Evidence: task structured result (`task_id=task_02`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | result invariant] OUTCAR for the production run contains clean completion markers