Added concrete success criteria and provenance requirement for final reported observables.\n\n</editable_file>\n<editable_file path=\"MEMORY/topics/FACTS.md\">\n# FACTS\n\n## TL;DR\n- Canonical definitions: Energy-per-atom and bond-length reporting definitions for this O2 task.\n- Verified facts: Baseline triplet O2 gas-phase protocol was prepared/executed successfully, and final total energy, energy per atom, and relaxed O–O bond distance were extracted with provenance.\n- Tentative hypotheses: (empty)\n\n## Canonical Definitions\n- **Final total energy (this task):** `TOTEN` from the last converged ionic step in `OUTCAR` (`free energy TOTEN`), units `eV`.\n- **Energy per atom (this task):** `E_per_atom = E_final_ionic_step / 2` for O2, units `eV/atom`.\n- **Final O–O bond length (this task):** distance between the two O atoms in the relaxed final structure (`CONTCAR`) evaluated with minimum-image convention (MIC), units `Å`.\n\n## Verified Facts\n- [2026-03-02 | method invariant] Approved baseline protocol for isolated O2 (triplet) in vacuum:\n  - Spin targeting: `ISPIN=2`, `NUPDOWN=2`.\n  - Cell model: cubic box with ~10 Å vacuum padding (about 20 Å lattice).\n  - Baseline settings from MPRelaxSet: PBE-level defaults including `ENCUT=520 eV`, `PREC=Accurate`, `LASPH=.TRUE.`.\n  - Gas-phase preset choices: `calc_type='gas'` with `Γ-only (1×1×1)`, `ISYM=0`, `LREAL=False`, `ISIF=2`.\n  - Ionic relaxation intent: `IBRION=2`, `NSW>0`, tight `EDIFF` (`1e-6`), `EDIFFG` around `-0.02 eV/Å` (acceptable range noted `-0.01` to `-0.02 eV/Å`).\n  - Dispersion correction: off (single isolated molecule in vacuum).\n  - Evidence: task structured result (`task_id=plan_commit`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | result invariant] Isolated O2 structure generated at `structures/o2_box/O2.vasp` with a `20×20×20 Å` lattice; O Cartesian positions are `z=9.395 Å` and `z=10.605 Å`, giving a `1.21 Å` bond centered in the box.\n  - Evidence: `structures/o2_box/O2.vasp`; task structured result (`task_id=task_01`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | result invariant] Gas-phase relaxation input set prepared at `vasp_inputs/o2_gas_relax/O2` containing `POSCAR`, `INCAR`, `KPOINTS`, and `POTCAR`.\n  - Evidence: task structured result (`task_id=task_01`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | result invariant] Prepared INCAR was verified to include `IBRION=2`, `NSW=500`, `ISPIN=2`, `NUPDOWN=2`, `ISYM=0`, and `LREAL=False`.\n  - Evidence: `reports/o2_incar_check.txt`; task structured result (`task_id=task_01`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | acceptance invariant] Planned validation checks for production run:\n  - Force convergence target at or below `0.02 eV/Å`.\n  - No obvious SCF failure patterns during relaxation.\n  - Evidence: task structured result (`task_id=plan_commit`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | result invariant] VASP gas-phase triplet O2 relaxation executed in single-folder batch mode using input `vasp_inputs/o2_gas_relax/O2`, producing run output directory `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2`.\n  - Evidence: task structured result (`task_id=task_02`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | result invariant] OUTCAR for the production run contains clean completion markers: `reached required accuracy - stopping structural energy minimisation` (line 4928) and `General timing and accounting informations for this job` (line 4944).\n  - Evidence: `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/OUTCAR`; task structured result (`task_id=task_02`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | result invariant] OSZICAR final ionic-step entry is `4 F= -.98846517E+01 ... mag=     2.0000`, consistent with converged triplet-targeted output.\n  - Evidence: `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/OSZICAR`; task structured result (`task_id=task_02`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | result invariant] Required production outputs are present in `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2`: `OUTCAR`, `CONTCAR`, `OSZICAR`, `vasprun.xml`.\n  - Evidence: `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2`; task structured result (`task_id=task_02`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | result invariant] Final `OUTCAR` total energy extracted from the last `free energy TOTEN` record is `-9.88465166 eV` (line 4898).\n  - Evidence: `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/OUTCAR`; `analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.json`; task structured result (`task_id=task_03`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | result invariant] Final energy per atom for O2 is `-4.94232583 eV/atom`, computed as `TOTEN/2`.\n  - Evidence: `analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.json`; `analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.txt`; task structured result (`task_id=task_03`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | result invariant] Relaxed O–O bond distance from final `CONTCAR` using MIC is `1.2332978239 Å`.\n  - Evidence: `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/CONTCAR`; `analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.json`; task structured result (`task_id=task_03`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02 | validation invariant] OSZICAR cross-check gives final `F = -9.88465170 eV`; difference `TOTEN - F = 4.0e-08 eV` (rounding-level agreement).\n  - Evidence: `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/OSZICAR`; `analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.json`; task structured result (`task_id=task_03`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n\n## Tentative\n- (empty)\n\n## Decision Log\n- [2026-03-02] **Plan committed** for execution.\n  - Rationale: Approved for execution.\n  - Evidence: task structured result (`task_id=plan_commit`, `run_id=run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`).\n- [2026-03-02] **Post-edited INCAR to enforce `NUPDOWN=2` explicitly.**\n  - Rationale: `vasp_relax_prepare` in this environment did not expose `user_incar_settings`; explicit post-edit preserves the triplet-targeting invariant.\n  - Evidence: `vasp_inputs/o2_gas_relax/O2/INCAR`; `reports/o2_incar_check.txt`; task structured result (`task_id=task_01`, `run_id=run