18:04:42 INFO catmaster.llm.factory | [llm.http.raw_post] provider=openrouter model=openai/gpt-5-nano method=POST url=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/chat/completions body={"messages":[{"content":"You are a scientific workflow assistant. Write the final report for the user.\nUse the memory index excerpt, task observations, and artifact list to produce a concise scientific summary.\nInclude key numerical results (energies, bond lengths, convergence data) if present.\nReference outputs with project-files-relative paths only. Do not mention internal metadata directories.","role":"system"},{"content":"User request: Compute O2 in a box: prepare VASP inputs from scratch, DO perform VASP calculation to get the results, and report final energy per atom and O–O bond distance from vasp results.\nStatus: running\n\nMemory index excerpt:\n# MEMORY (AUTOLOADED INDEX)\n\n## What this is\n- Autoloaded memory index for this project.\n- Keep this file concise and pointer-first.\n- Put details in MEMORY/topics/*.md.\n\n## Latest State\n- Current focus: Preserve finalized O2 gas-phase relaxation observables with provenance for reuse.\n- Current milestone: Run finalized (`task_id=finalize_memory`, run: `run_20260302_095018_3a4d0c`) with all tasks complete (3/3) and final O2 observables captured with provenance.\n- Latest run artifacts: `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/{OUTCAR,OSZICAR,CONTCAR,vasprun.xml}` and `analysis/o2_gas_relax/{summary.json,summary.txt}`.\n- Next action: None; results are ready for downstream summary/reporting reuse.\n\n## Top Constraints\n1. Final report must include final total energy (eV), energy per atom (eV/atom), and O–O bond distance (Å) from the final relaxed VASP step with provenance.\n\n## Active Open Questions\n1. None currently (run state finalized).\n\n## Pointers\n- Goal / principles: MEMORY/topics/GOAL.md\n- Facts / decisions: MEMORY/topics/FACTS.md\n- Files / artifacts: MEMORY/topics/FILES.md\n- Constraints: MEMORY/topics/CONSTRAINTS.md\n- Open questions: MEMORY/topics/QUESTIONS.md\n- Runbook: MEMORY/topics/RUNBOOK.md\n\n## Keyword Map\n- GOAL: objective, success criteria, scope, non-goals\n- FACTS: definition, verified, result, decision\n- FILES: path, artifact, dataset, output, script\n- CONSTRAINTS: must, cannot, policy, budget\n- QUESTIONS: unknown, blocked, clarify, decide\n- RUNBOOK: steps, checklist, verify\n\n\nTask observations:\n[{\"task_id\": \"task_01\", \"outcome\": \"success\", \"summary\": \"Created isolated O2 structure in a 20 Å cubic box at structures/o2_box/O2.vasp, prepared gas-phase VASP relaxation inputs under vasp_inputs/o2_gas_relax/O2, and explicitly set triplet targeting in INCAR with NUPDOWN = 2 (ISPIN = 2 retained). Verified required input files and key INCAR tags.\", \"key_artifacts\": [{\"path\": \"structures/o2_box/O2.vasp\", \"description\": \"Isolated O2 structure in 20 Å cubic vacuum box (Cartesian coordinates).\", \"kind\": \"output\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_inputs/o2_gas_relax/O2\", \"description\": \"Prepared VASP gas-phase relaxation input set containing POSCAR/INCAR/KPOINTS/POTCAR.\", \"kind\": \"dir\"}, {\"path\": \"reports/o2_incar_check.txt\", \"description\": \"Concise snippet confirming key INCAR settings for triplet gas-phase relaxation.\", \"kind\": \"report\"}], \"decisions\": [\"Applied a post-edit to INCAR to enforce NUPDOWN = 2 explicitly. (vasp_relax_prepare schema in this environment does not expose user_incar_settings; post-edit satisfies the hard triplet-targeting invariant.)\"], \"facts\": [\"O2 structure written to structures/o2_box/O2.vasp with 20×20×20 Å lattice and Cartesian O positions at z = 9.395 and 10.605 Å (1.21 Å bond length, centered).\", \"vasp_relax_prepare completed successfully for calc_type='gas' with output directory vasp_inputs/o2_gas_relax/O2.\", \"Prepared directory contains POSCAR, INCAR, KPOINTS, and POTCAR.\", \"INCAR contains: IBRION = 2, NSW = 500 (>0), ISPIN = 2, NUPDOWN = 2, ISYM = 0, LREAL = False (verified in reports/o2_incar_check.txt).\"]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_02\", \"outcome\": \"success\", \"summary\": \"Executed VASP for prepared triplet O2 gas-phase relaxation using single-folder batch mode from `vasp_inputs/o2_gas_relax/O2`. Run completed successfully with clean termination markers in OUTCAR and required output files present under `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2`.\", \"key_artifacts\": [{\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2\", \"description\": \"Completed VASP run directory for gas-phase triplet O2 relaxation.\", \"kind\": \"dir\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/OUTCAR\", \"description\": \"Main VASP output containing convergence and termination markers.\", \"kind\": \"output\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/OSZICAR\", \"description\": \"Electronic/ionic step log with final F and magnetic moment entries.\", \"kind\": \"output\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/CONTCAR\", \"description\": \"Final relaxed structure.\", \"kind\": \"output\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/vasprun.xml\", \"description\": \"XML run record produced by VASP.\", \"kind\": \"output\"}], \"decisions\": [\"Did not modify INCAR. (Run succeeded cleanly on first execution, so failure-handling edits were unnecessary.)\"], \"next_steps\": [\"If needed for downstream reporting, extract final energy/atom and O–O bond length from `OUTCAR`/`CONTCAR` in `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2`.\"], \"facts\": [\"VASP execution used `vasp_execute_batch` with input_dir=`vasp_inputs/o2_gas_relax/O2` and output_dir=`vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax`, producing output folder `vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2`.\", \"OUTCAR contains clean completion markers: `reached required accuracy - stopping structural energy minimisation` (line 4928) and `General timing and accounting informations for this job` (line 4944).\", \"OSZICAR tail shows final ionic step entry `4 F= -.98846517E+01 ... mag= 2.0000`, consistent with converged triplet run output.\", \"Key files present in run directory: OUTCAR, CONTCAR, OSZICAR, and vasprun.xml.\"]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_03\", \"outcome\": \"success\", \"summary\": \"Parsed final O2 relaxation outputs and wrote machine/human summaries with provenance at analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.json and analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.txt. Extracted last OUTCAR TOTEN with exact line number/text, computed energy per atom (2-atom O2), and computed MIC O–O distance from CONTCAR. Printed all required values to stdout, with optional OSZICAR cross-check.\", \"key_artifacts\": [{\"path\": \"analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.json\", \"description\": \"Machine-readable summary containing toten_eV, energy_per_atom_eV, oo_bond_A, and provenance (OUTCAR line number/text + CONTCAR path), plus optional OSZICAR cross-check fields.\", \"kind\": \"output\"}, {\"path\": \"analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.txt\", \"description\": \"Human-readable summary with the same core values and provenance.\", \"kind\": \"report\"}], \"decisions\": [\"Used ASE distance with mic=True on CONTCAR for O–O bond length. (Directly enforces minimum-image convention in the periodic 20 Å cell.)\"], \"facts\": [\"Final OUTCAR TOTEN = -9.88465166 eV from line 4898 in vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/OUTCAR (matching text: ' free energy TOTEN = -9.88465166 eV').\", \"Energy per atom = -4.94232583 eV/atom (TOTEN/2).\", \"Relaxed O–O bond distance from vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/CONTCAR using MIC = 1.2332978239 Å.\", \"OSZICAR last F = -9.88465170 eV; TOTEN - F = 4.0e-08 eV (consistent within rounding).\"]}]\n\nArtifact list:\n[{\"path\": \"analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.txt\", \"description\": \"Human-readable summary of the same final observables and provenance\", \"kind\": \"report\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"analysis/o2_gas_relax/summary.json\", \"description\": \"Machine-readable parsed final observables (TOTEN, eV/atom, O–O distance) with provenance and optional OSZICAR consistency check\", \"kind\": \"output\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/vasprun.xml\", \"description\": \"XML run record of the completed VASP relaxation\", \"kind\": \"output\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/CONTCAR\", \"description\": \"Final relaxed O2 structure for bond-length extraction\", \"kind\": \"output\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/OSZICAR\", \"description\": \"Electronic/ionic step log containing final total energy and magnetic moment entries\", \"kind\": \"output\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2/OUTCAR\", \"description\": \"Main VASP output with ionic convergence and clean termination markers\", \"kind\": \"output\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_runs/o2_gas_relax/O2\", \"description\": \"Completed VASP run directory for gas-phase triplet O2 relaxation\", \"kind\": \"dir\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"reports/o2_incar_check.txt\", \"description\": \"Verification snippet confirming key INCAR tags for the prepared O2 gas-phase run\", \"kind\": \"report\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_inputs/o2_gas_relax/O2/INCAR\", \"description\": \"INCAR for gas-phase relaxation with explicit triplet targeting (`ISPIN=2`, `NUPDOWN=2`)\", \"kind\": \"artifact\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"vasp_inputs/o2_gas_relax/O2\", \"description\": \"Prepared VASP gas-phase relaxation input set containing POSCAR/INCAR/KPOINTS/POTCAR\", \"kind\": \"dir\", \"type\": \"file\"}, {\"path\": \"structures/o2_box/O2.vasp\", \"description\": \"Isolated O2 structure in a 20 Å cubic vacuum box (Cartesian coordinates; 1.21 Å bond)\", \"kind\": \"output\", \"type\": \"file\"}]","role":"user"}],"model":"openai/gpt-5-nano","stream":false,"temperature":1.0,"prompt_cache_retention":"24h"}
